Honor PYTHONTZPATH in the ZoneInfo copy in Lib/test/datetimetester.py.
That copy hardcodes zoneroot = '/usr/share/zoneinfo'.
The toolchain glibc reads $EASYBUILD_SYSROOT/usr/share/zoneinfo instead, so IranTest_Fast.test_system_transitions fails during the profile-guided optimization run.
Author: Rohit Goswami (SURF)

diff -ru Python-3.14.8.orig/Lib/test/datetimetester.py Python-3.14.8/Lib/test/datetimetester.py
--- Python-3.14.8.orig/Lib/test/datetimetester.py
+++ Python-3.14.8/Lib/test/datetimetester.py
@@ -6473,7 +6473,8 @@
     return zip(a, b)
 
 class ZoneInfo(tzinfo):
-    zoneroot = '/usr/share/zoneinfo'
+    # Match the zoneinfo tree the process libc uses when PYTHONTZPATH is set.
+    zoneroot = os.environ.get('PYTHONTZPATH', '/usr/share/zoneinfo').split(os.pathsep)[0]
     def __init__(self, ut, ti):
         """
 
